[0,"o","\u001b[2J\u001b[H\r\n\n                                    ORIFUDE\n\n\n  ╭How this paper works──────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\n  │The paper is ready.                                                       │\n  │Match the paper to the shown pattern.                                     │\n  │                                                                          │\n  │1  An available tool is already ready.                                    │\n  │2  + shows a fold's moving side. Enter folds.                             │\n  │3  Arrows move @. Enter brushes every layer.                              │\n  │4  When the target matches, Enter opens the paper.                        │\n  │                                                                          │\n  │Tab changes tools. Esc readies Open paper.                                │\n  │? explains the tools. u undoes. r resets.                                 │\n  │Enter starts the lesson. Esc leaves.                                      │\n  │                                                                          │\n  │                                                                          │\n  │                                                                          │\n  │                                                                          │\n  ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\n                          Enter start · ? help · q quit\n\n\n"]
[1.5,"o","\u001b[2J\u001b[H\r\n\n                                    ORIFUDE\n\n\n  ╭FOLDED PAPER─────────────────────────────────────────╮╭Low to high────────╮\n  │                      @ + o o                        ││row 1, column 1    │\n  │                      + + o o                        ││0: cell 0          │\n  │                      + + o o                        ││                   │\n  │                      + + o o                        ││Right at crease 2  │\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  ╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯╰───────────────────╯\n  ╭Paper─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\n  │One fold, one mark  Folds 0/1  Ink 0/1                                    │\n  │Ready: Fold right, crease 2 · Enter folds                                 │\n  │Guide: The fold tool is ready. Press Enter to fold the + side.            │\n  ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\n  Arrows change fold · Tab tool/open · Enter fold · t target · ? help · q quit\n\n\n"]
[3,"o","\u001b[2J\u001b[H\r\n\n                                    ORIFUDE\n\n\n  ╭FOLDED PAPER─────────────────────────────────────────╮╭Low to high────────╮\n  │                      @   2 2                        ││row 1, column 1    │\n  │                          2 2                        ││empty              │\n  │                          2 2                        ││                   │\n  │                          2 2                        ││                   │\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  ╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯╰───────────────────╯\n  ╭Paper─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\n  │One fold, one mark  Folds 1/1  Ink 0/1                                    │\n  │Fold complete. The dot brush is ready.                                    │\n  │Guide: Move @ to row 2, column 3 with the arrow keys.                     │\n  ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\n     Arrows move @ · Tab tool/open · Enter ink · t target · ? help · q quit\n\n\n"]
[4.5,"o","\u001b[2J\u001b[H\r\n\n                                    ORIFUDE\n\n\n  ╭FOLDED PAPER─────────────────────────────────────────╮╭Low to high────────╮\n  │                          2 2                        ││row 2, column 3    │\n  │                          ◉ 2                        ││0: cell 6 ink      │\n  │                          2 2                        ││1: cell 5 ink      │\n  │                          2 2                        ││                   │\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  ╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯╰───────────────────╯\n  ╭Paper─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\n  │One fold, one mark  Folds 1/1  Ink 1/1                                    │\n  │Ink reached 2 layers. Enter opens the paper.                              │\n  │Guide: The target is inked. Press Enter to open.                          │\n  ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\n    Arrows inspect · Tab tool/open · Enter open · t target · ? help · q quit\n\n\n"]
[6,"o","\u001b[2J\u001b[H\r\n\n                                    ORIFUDE\n\n\n  ╭OPENED COMPARISON────────────────────────────────────╮╭Low to high────────╮\n  │                      . . . .                        ││row 2, column 3    │\n  │╭Paper complete──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮│\n  ││               Congratulations, your first paper matches.               ││\n  ││                  The branch is ready for the journey.                  ││\n  ││                     Your keepsake is saved safely.                     ││\n  ││                 Enter returns to the branch · r retries                ││\n  ││                                                                        ││\n  │╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯│\n  │                                                     ││                   │\n  ╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯╰───────────────────╯\n  ╭Paper─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\n  │One fold, one mark  Folds 1/1  Ink 1/1                                    │\n  │Opened paper: 0 missing (?) and 0 extra (!).                              │\n  │Lesson complete. Enter returns to the home branch.                        │\n  │                                                                          │\n  ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\n                    Enter branch · r retry · ? help · q quit\n\n\n"]
[7.5,"o","\u001b[2J\u001b[H\r\n\n                                     ORIFUDE\n\n\n          ⢰ ⢀⣠⠾⠛⠛⡁· ⣠⠶⠋·  ⣧⠞· ⢠⠆ ⢀·\n  ⣤⣤⣤⣀⣀⣀⡤⠴⠺⠋⠁⠁  ⣠⡧⠖⠛⠁  ⣸⠴⠋⠘  ⡰⠃⣠⢴⠏ ⢠⠞        ⢀\n    ⠉⠉⠙⠛⠻⠷⣶⣤⣴⣒⠚⠉⠉  ⣀⡠⠖⠋⠙    ⣀⠴⠊⠡⠋ ⠐⠁   ⡴ ⢀⠞⢀⡴⠋\n           ⠙⢯⡙⠻⠷⣶⣶⣋⡁    ⣀⡤⠖⠋⠁       ⢀⣀⡾⠤⠴⠛⠚⠉⠁·\n            ⢠⠛⢦ ⠈⠻⣍⠛⠿⢶⣶⣍⣁⡀    ⣀⣠⠤⠖⠒⠉⠉           ╭Home | Journey 0/40─────────╮\n           ⠠⠃  ⡳⡄ ⠈⠳⡀ ⠈⢯⡙⠻⠿⢶⣮⡍⠁                 │› Continue the journey      │\n              ⣰⠃⠘⣆  ⠙⣆  ⠙⢦⡀ ⠙⠻⢶⣦⣄⣀              │  Today's paper             │\n              ⠁ ⢀⡎⢦ ⢸⠙⣆⡀  ⠙⢦⡀  ⠈⠙⢺⠭⣒⡦⢤⣀         │  Endless garden            │\n                ⠞ ⠈·⠃ ⣸⡇    ⡝⢦⡀  ⡏  ⠉⡕⠲⠭⢄⣀⡀     │  Puzzle packs              │\n                  ⢀⡎ ⠰⠃⠸⡄⡄ ⡸  ⠙⣦⡘   ⢀⠇  ⡸ ⠉⠙⡖⠒  │  Keepsakes                 │\n                  ⠞     ⣿ ⠰⠃  ⢰⠁⠉⠲⣄ ⠸  ⢀⡇   ⢸   │  How to play               │\n                       ⠰·    ⢠⠇  ⢀⡎·   ⠘    ⠈⠇  │  Terminal settings         │\n                                                ╰────────────────────────────╯\n    The branch is waiting for its first leaf.\n                      [0/8]\n\n\n                   Up/Down move · Enter open · ? help · q quit\n"]
